"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>An <b>offering</b> is a gift or <a href=\"#t114\">sacrifice</a> offered in a ritual to God, usually in the <a href=\"#t138\">temple</a> or on a special <a href=\"#t3\">altar</a>. People can make offerings for many reasons, including to give thanks, to be <a href=\"#t208\">purified</a>, or to ask <a href=\"#t53\">forgiveness</a> for <a href=\"#t125\">sin</a>.</p>",
